# Build-context exclusions for the SERVER image (context: ./server).
# Keeps the runtime image minimal; ensures secrets are not even sent to the
# daemon. The Dockerfile only COPYs app.py and requirements.txt.
.env
README.md
freeshow-receiver.service
freeshow-bridge.service
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
data/
